DESCRIPTION:The Artist Residency Center ( Centro de residencias artística
 s - CRA)\, located in Nave 16 at Matadero Madrid\, is a space for work and
  shared living among diverse artists and cultural practitioners who exchan
 ge working processes\, research\, and creation. Throughout the year\, vari
 ous activities offer a glimpse into what happens behind closed doors\, but
  it is during the Open House that all residents share their work directly 
 with the public. This upcoming Open House features the eight artists from 
 the quarterly Art and Environment residencies: Miguel Alejos\, Mauricio Fr
 eyre\, Ignacio García Sánchez\, Gelen Jeleton\, Carlos Monleón\, Juan P
 ablo Pacheco\, Ana Robles Pérez\, and Sofía Tudela. The advisor\nCategor
